(480,269,$mw$81EFC04C313D290665EBC3965B235F5E5763E84BB133CD5D40A145F6B1255FD7$mw$,$mw$e405bda0be100b7250e329a95743b6c8$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":269,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-7x+10=0\\)؟","TitleEn":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-7x+10=0\\)?","QuestionTextAr":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-7x+10=0\\)؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-7x+10=0\\)?","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون فييتا لمعادلة تربيعية أ س² + ب س + ج = 0: حاصل ضرب الجذرين = ج ÷ أ. في س² − 7س + 10 = 0 معامل س² هو 1 والحد الثابت 10، لذا حاصل الضرب = 10 ÷ 1 = 10. التحقق: التحليل (س − 2)(س − 5) يعطي الجذرين 2 و5 ومنتجهما 10.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Vieta's theorem: For ax² + bx + c = 0, the product of the two roots is c/a. In x² − 7x + 10 = 0, a = 1 and c = 10, so root product = 10/1 = 10. Check: factoring as (x − 2)(x − 5) yields roots 2, 5 with product 10.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1065,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"13","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1066,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1067,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1068,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل علاقات فييتا أو اقرأ الجذور من العوامل.","En":"Use Vieta's formulas or read the roots from the factors."},{"Ar":"اقسم الحد الثابت على معامل المربع.","En":"Divide the constant term by the leading coefficient."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-7x+10=0\\)؟","En":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-7x+10=0\\)?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 13 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 10.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 13 by it does not recover constant 10."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"13"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 8 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 10.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 8 by it does not recover constant 10."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"8"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"10"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 11 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 10.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 11 by it does not recover constant 10."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"11"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-7x+10=0\\)؟","En":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-7x+10=0\\)?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"علاقات فييتا تربط حاصل ضرب الجذور بالحد الثابت ومعامل المربع.","En":"Vieta's formulas connect the product of roots to the constant and quadratic coefficient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=10$.","En":"The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=10$."},{"Ar":"طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\\frac{10}{1}=10$.","En":"Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\\frac{10}{1}=10$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط قانون المجموع بقانون الجداء.","En":"Do not confuse the sum and product rules."},"FormulaLatex":"r_1r_2=\\frac{c}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{10}{1}=10$","En":"$\\frac{10}{1}=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"بالتفكيك: $(x-2)(x-5)=x^2-7x+10$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 10.","En":"Factoring gives $(x-2)(x-5)=x^2-7x+10$; the roots multiply to 10."}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":43,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل علاقات فييتا أو اقرأ الجذور من العوامل.","En":"Use Vieta's formulas or read the roots from the factors."},{"Ar":"اقسم الحد الثابت على معامل المربع.","En":"Divide the constant term by the leading coefficient."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"علاقات فييتا تربط حاصل ضرب الجذور بالحد الثابت ومعامل المربع.","En":"Vieta's formulas connect the product of roots to the constant and quadratic coefficient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=10$.","En":"The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=10$."},{"Ar":"طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\\frac{10}{1}=10$.","En":"Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\\frac{10}{1}=10$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط قانون المجموع بقانون الجداء.","En":"Do not confuse the sum and product rules."},"FormulaLatex":"r_1r_2=\\frac{c}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{10}{1}=10$","En":"$\\frac{10}{1}=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"بالتفكيك: $(x-2)(x-5)=x^2-7x+10$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 10.","En":"Factoring gives $(x-2)(x-5)=x^2-7x+10$; the roots multiply to 10."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 13 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 10.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 13 by it does not recover constant 10."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 8 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 10.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 8 by it does not recover constant 10."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 11 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 10.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 11 by it does not recover constant 10."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$علاقات فييتا تربط حاصل ضرب الجذور بالحد الثابت ومعامل المربع.

$r_1r_2=\frac{c}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=10$.

2. طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\frac{10}{1}=10$.

$\frac{10}{1}=10$

$10$ بلا وحدة قياس

بالتفكيك: $(x-2)(x-5)=x^2-7x+10$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 10.

لا تخلط قانون المجموع بقانون الجداء.$mw$,$mw$Vieta's formulas connect the product of roots to the constant and quadratic coefficient.

$r_1r_2=\frac{c}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=10$.

2. Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\frac{10}{1}=10$.

$\frac{10}{1}=10$

$10$ Dimensionless

Factoring gives $(x-2)(x-5)=x^2-7x+10$; the roots multiply to 10.

Do not confuse the sum and product rules.$mw$),
(481,270,$mw$11D31FDE4DB4ECD240D7FB527C60E5E4E3F3A87D01E73130FE7313D4E3498ACF$mw$,$mw$f5b72ad224d2208885b6e452c31d5257$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":270,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+2x+3=0\\).","TitleEn":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+2x+3=0\\).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+2x+3=0\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+2x+3=0\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مميّز المعادلة التربيعية أ س² + ب س + ج = 0 هو Δ = ب² − 4أج. في س² + 2س + 3 = 0 لدينا أ = 1، ب = 2، ج = 3. بالتعويض: Δ = 2² − 4 × 1 × 3 = 4 − 12 = -8. إشارة المميز تساعد لاحقاً في تحديد عدد الجذور الحقيقية.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Quadratic discriminant law: For ax² + bx + c = 0, Δ = b² − 4ac. In x² + 2x + 3 = 0, a = 1, b = 2, c = 3. Substitute: Δ = 2² − 4 × 1 × 3 = 4 − 12 = -8. The discriminant sign can then classify real roots.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1069,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-10","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1070,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"-8","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1071,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"-7","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1072,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"-5","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استخدم المميز للمعادلة التربيعية.","En":"Use the quadratic discriminant."},{"Ar":"ربّع معامل x ثم اطرح أربعة أمثال حاصل ضرب معامل المربع والثابت.","En":"Square the x coefficient and subtract four times the product of the leading and constant coefficients."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+2x+3=0\\).","En":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+2x+3=0\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -10 فإن إضافة $4ac=12$ تعطي 2 وليس $b^2=4$.","En":"If the discriminant were -10, adding $4ac=12$ would give 2, not $b^2=4$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-10"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"-8"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -7 فإن إضافة $4ac=12$ تعطي 5 وليس $b^2=4$.","En":"If the discriminant were -7, adding $4ac=12$ would give 5, not $b^2=4$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-7"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -5 فإن إضافة $4ac=12$ تعطي 7 وليس $b^2=4$.","En":"If the discriminant were -5, adding $4ac=12$ would give 7, not $b^2=4$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-5"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+2x+3=0\\).","En":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+2x+3=0\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مميز المعادلة التربيعية يحدد طبيعة جذورها الحقيقية.","En":"A quadratic discriminant determines the nature of its real roots."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المعاملات: $a=1$ و$b=2$ و$c=3$.","En":"Identify coefficients $a=1$, $b=2$ and $c=3$."},{"Ar":"احسب $b^2=4$ و$4ac=12$ ثم اطرح.","En":"Compute $b^2=4$ and $4ac=12$, then subtract."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-8$","En":"$-8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"انتبه إلى إشارة الطرح؛ قد يكون المميز سالباً.","En":"Preserve subtraction; the discriminant may be negative."},"FormulaLatex":"\\Delta=b^2-4ac","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\Delta=2^2-4(1)(3)=-8$","En":"$\\Delta=2^2-4(1)(3)=-8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-8+12=4$","En":"$-8+12=4$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":44,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استخدم المميز للمعادلة التربيعية.","En":"Use the quadratic discriminant."},{"Ar":"ربّع معامل x ثم اطرح أربعة أمثال حاصل ضرب معامل المربع والثابت.","En":"Square the x coefficient and subtract four times the product of the leading and constant coefficients."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مميز المعادلة التربيعية يحدد طبيعة جذورها الحقيقية.","En":"A quadratic discriminant determines the nature of its real roots."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المعاملات: $a=1$ و$b=2$ و$c=3$.","En":"Identify coefficients $a=1$, $b=2$ and $c=3$."},{"Ar":"احسب $b^2=4$ و$4ac=12$ ثم اطرح.","En":"Compute $b^2=4$ and $4ac=12$, then subtract."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-8$","En":"$-8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"انتبه إلى إشارة الطرح؛ قد يكون المميز سالباً.","En":"Preserve subtraction; the discriminant may be negative."},"FormulaLatex":"\\Delta=b^2-4ac","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\Delta=2^2-4(1)(3)=-8$","En":"$\\Delta=2^2-4(1)(3)=-8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-8+12=4$","En":"$-8+12=4$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -10 فإن إضافة $4ac=12$ تعطي 2 وليس $b^2=4$.","En":"If the discriminant were -10, adding $4ac=12$ would give 2, not $b^2=4$."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -7 فإن إضافة $4ac=12$ تعطي 5 وليس $b^2=4$.","En":"If the discriminant were -7, adding $4ac=12$ would give 5, not $b^2=4$."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -5 فإن إضافة $4ac=12$ تعطي 7 وليس $b^2=4$.","En":"If the discriminant were -5, adding $4ac=12$ would give 7, not $b^2=4$."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$مميز المعادلة التربيعية يحدد طبيعة جذورها الحقيقية.

$\Delta=b^2-4ac$

1. حدد المعاملات: $a=1$ و$b=2$ و$c=3$.

2. احسب $b^2=4$ و$4ac=12$ ثم اطرح.

$\Delta=2^2-4(1)(3)=-8$

$-8$ بلا وحدة قياس

$-8+12=4$

انتبه إلى إشارة الطرح؛ قد يكون المميز سالباً.$mw$,$mw$A quadratic discriminant determines the nature of its real roots.

$\Delta=b^2-4ac$

1. Identify coefficients $a=1$, $b=2$ and $c=3$.

2. Compute $b^2=4$ and $4ac=12$, then subtract.

$\Delta=2^2-4(1)(3)=-8$

$-8$ Dimensionless

$-8+12=4$

Preserve subtraction; the discriminant may be negative.$mw$),
(482,271,$mw$0C5AA530A73261AA86D1A41E713176D662B05C328B090D14589E9F99AC056DFA$mw$,$mw$ab7bb09038a6217c8017573b0f991e42$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":271,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حلّل \\(x^2+5x+6\\) إلى عوامل.","TitleEn":"Factor \\(x^2+5x+6\\).","QuestionTextAr":"حلّل \\(x^2+5x+6\\) إلى عوامل.","QuestionTextEn":"Factor \\(x^2+5x+6\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: لتحليل س² + 5س + 6 نبحث عن عددين مجموعهما 5 وحاصل ضربهما 6. العددان 2 و3 لأن 2 + 3 = 5 و2 × 3 = 6. إذن التحليل (س + 2)(س + 3). التحقق بالتوزيع: س² + (2 + 3)س + 2×3 يعيد المقدار الأصلي.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Factoring rule: To factor x² + 5x + 6, find two numbers with sum 5 and product 6. They are 2 and 3 because 2 + 3 = 5 and 2 × 3 = 6. Therefore the factors are (x + 2)(x + 3). Expanding reproduces x² + 5x + 6.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1073,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"(x+2)(x+3)","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1074,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"(x-2)(x-3)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1075,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"(x+2)(x-3)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1076,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"(x+1)(x+6)","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"قارن الحد الخطي والثابت مع صورة حاصل ضرب عاملين.","En":"Compare the linear and constant terms with a product of two factors."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن عددين يحققان شرطي المجموع والجداء معاً.","En":"Find two numbers satisfying both sum and product conditions."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حلّل \\(x^2+5x+6\\) إلى عوامل.","En":"Factor \\(x^2+5x+6\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"(x+2)(x+3)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -5 والثابت 6؛ المطلوب 5 و6 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -5 and constant 6; both must instead be 5 and 6."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(x-2)(x-3)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -1 والثابت -6؛ المطلوب 5 و6 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -1 and constant -6; both must instead be 5 and 6."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(x+2)(x-3)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو 7 والثابت 6؛ المطلوب 5 و6 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient 7 and constant 6; both must instead be 5 and 6."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(x+1)(x+6)"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"حلّل \\(x^2+5x+6\\) إلى عوامل.","En":"Factor \\(x^2+5x+6\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نحلل ثلاثي الحدود الأحادي إلى عاملين باستخدام مجموع العددين وحاصل ضربهما.","En":"Factor a monic trinomial using the sum and product of two numbers."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحتاج عددين مجموعهما 5 وحاصل ضربهما 6.","En":"Find two integers with sum 5 and product 6."},{"Ar":"العددان 2 و3 يحققان الشرطين، لذا اكتب $(x+2)(x+3)$.","En":"The values 2 and 3 meet both conditions, so write $(x+2)(x+3)$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(x+2)(x+3)$","En":"$(x+2)(x+3)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تختَر عاملين يحققان الحد الثابت فقط أو تعكس الإشارات.","En":"Do not choose factors that match only the constant or reverse their signs."},"FormulaLatex":"x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x^2+5x+6=(x+2)(x+3)$","En":"$x^2+5x+6=(x+2)(x+3)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2+3=5,\\quad2\\times3=6$","En":"$2+3=5,\\quad2\\times3=6$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":45,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"قارن الحد الخطي والثابت مع صورة حاصل ضرب عاملين.","En":"Compare the linear and constant terms with a product of two factors."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن عددين يحققان شرطي المجموع والجداء معاً.","En":"Find two numbers satisfying both sum and product conditions."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نحلل ثلاثي الحدود الأحادي إلى عاملين باستخدام مجموع العددين وحاصل ضربهما.","En":"Factor a monic trinomial using the sum and product of two numbers."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحتاج عددين مجموعهما 5 وحاصل ضربهما 6.","En":"Find two integers with sum 5 and product 6."},{"Ar":"العددان 2 و3 يحققان الشرطين، لذا اكتب $(x+2)(x+3)$.","En":"The values 2 and 3 meet both conditions, so write $(x+2)(x+3)$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(x+2)(x+3)$","En":"$(x+2)(x+3)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تختَر عاملين يحققان الحد الثابت فقط أو تعكس الإشارات.","En":"Do not choose factors that match only the constant or reverse their signs."},"FormulaLatex":"x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x^2+5x+6=(x+2)(x+3)$","En":"$x^2+5x+6=(x+2)(x+3)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2+3=5,\\quad2\\times3=6$","En":"$2+3=5,\\quad2\\times3=6$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -5 والثابت 6؛ المطلوب 5 و6 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -5 and constant 6; both must instead be 5 and 6."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -1 والثابت -6؛ المطلوب 5 و6 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -1 and constant -6; both must instead be 5 and 6."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو 7 والثابت 6؛ المطلوب 5 و6 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient 7 and constant 6; both must instead be 5 and 6."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نحلل ثلاثي الحدود الأحادي إلى عاملين باستخدام مجموع العددين وحاصل ضربهما.

$x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)$

1. نحتاج عددين مجموعهما 5 وحاصل ضربهما 6.

2. العددان 2 و3 يحققان الشرطين، لذا اكتب $(x+2)(x+3)$.

$x^2+5x+6=(x+2)(x+3)$

$(x+2)(x+3)$ بلا وحدة قياس

$2+3=5,\quad2\times3=6$

لا تختَر عاملين يحققان الحد الثابت فقط أو تعكس الإشارات.$mw$,$mw$Factor a monic trinomial using the sum and product of two numbers.

$x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)$

1. Find two integers with sum 5 and product 6.

2. The values 2 and 3 meet both conditions, so write $(x+2)(x+3)$.

$x^2+5x+6=(x+2)(x+3)$

$(x+2)(x+3)$ Dimensionless

$2+3=5,\quad2\times3=6$

Do not choose factors that match only the constant or reverse their signs.$mw$),
(483,272,$mw$BC2C0DC00B1B1979A39372772E294BD60457373D47D40FF14DD2333EC4890E38$mw$,$mw$5109347df3cc223764e026b5abe7e0dd$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":272,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":10,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"مجاور الزاوية θ في مثلث قائم 4 والوتر 5، أوجد \\(\\cos\\theta\\).","TitleEn":"Right triangle: adjacent to θ is 4, hypotenuse 5. Find cos θ.","QuestionTextAr":"مجاور الزاوية θ في مثلث قائم 4 والوتر 5، أوجد \\(\\cos\\theta\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Right triangle: adjacent to θ is 4, hypotenuse 5. Find cos θ.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: cos(θ) = طول الضلع المجاور للزاوية ÷ طول الوتر في المثلث القائم. الضلع المجاور 4 والوتر 5؛ بالتعويض: cos(θ) = 4 ÷ 5 = 4/5. بما أن المجاور أقصر من الوتر فالنتيجة أقل من 1.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Right-triangle cosine rule: cos(θ) = adjacent side ÷ hypotenuse. With adjacent 4 and hypotenuse 5, substitute cos(θ) = 4/5. Since a triangle's leg is shorter than its hypotenuse, this positive ratio is below 1.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1077,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac{5}{4}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1078,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac{4}{5}","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1079,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac{3}{5}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1080,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{3}{4}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد النسبة المثلثية التي يطلبها السؤال.","En":"Identify the trigonometric ratio requested."},{"Ar":"استخدم المجاور في البسط والوتر في المقام.","En":"Use the adjacent in the numerator and hypotenuse in the denominator."}],"Title":{"Ar":"مجاور الزاوية θ في مثلث قائم 4 والوتر 5، أوجد \\(\\cos\\theta\\).","En":"Right triangle: adjacent to θ is 4, hypotenuse 5. Find cos θ."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"قلبت البسط والمقام؛ هذه مقلوب النسبة المطلوبة.","En":"The numerator and denominator are reversed; this is the reciprocal."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{5}{4}"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac{4}{5