"},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المقابل 5 والمجاور 12 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\\theta$.","En":"Identify the opposite 5 and adjacent 12 relative to $\\theta$."},{"Ar":"كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\\frac{5}{12}$.","En":"Form the ratio in the correct order: $\\frac{5}{12}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{5}{12}$","En":"$\\frac{5}{12}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس البسط والمقام أو تستخدم الضلع غير المطلوب.","En":"Do not reverse numerator and denominator or use the wrong side."},"FormulaLatex":"\\tan\\theta=\\frac{O}{A}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{5}{12}$","En":"$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{5}{12}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{5}{12}\\times12=5$","En":"$\\frac{5}{12}\\times12=5$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"قلبت البسط والمقام؛ هذه مقلوب النسبة المطلوبة.","En":"The numerator and denominator are reversed; this is the reciprocal."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على الوتر، وهذا جيب الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over hypotenuse, which is sine."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المجاور على الوتر، وهذا جيب التمام.","En":"This uses adjacent over hypotenuse, which is cosine."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$يرمز $O$ إلى طول المقابل و$A$ إلى المجاور غير الصفري.

